OL,3,GNEWSAPrisoner denies attempting to
OL,4,Amurder imam in jail
OL,5,
OL,6,FA serving prisoner accused of stabbing
OL,7,Fan imam five times in the head and neck
OL,8,Fhas denied attempted murder.
OL,10,FAhmed Alid, 47, appeared at the Old
OL,11,FBailey via video link from HMP
OL,12,FWakefield on Friday and pleaded not
OL,13,Fguilty to attempted murder, occasioning
OL,14,Factual bodily harm and possession of an
OL,15,Foffensive weapon.
OL,17,FThe court previously heard Alid
OL,18,Fallegedly attempted to murder Roderic
OL,19,FVassie at HMP Full Sutton, in East
OL,20,FYorkshire, after Friday prayers on 8
OL,21,FAugust 2025.
